<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: KPMG partner joins U2 management team.</title>
<headline>KPMG partner joins U2 management team.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Principle Management Ltd and Paul McGuinness, managers of U2, P.J. Harvey and U.S. artist Lazlo Bane, said on Friday that KPMG senior partner Trevor Bowen has joined as finance director, effective November 1.</p>
<p>Bowen, who was responsible for a wide range of industrial and banking clients at KPMG, will work with McGuinness on projects in the international entertainment business, Principle Management said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
